<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials rally seen halting.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Industrials rally seen halting.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------Australian All Industrials Index--------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 3945 3980 4000 *RSI-14 53.51 *MA-10 3950.8</p>
<p>3865 - 3920  *Sup 3900 3865 3830 *MA-20 3923.2 *MA-40 3835.5</p>
<p>--------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 20--------------</p>
<p>*Steep rally halts</p>
<p>*Indicators moving lower</p>
<p>*Traders focus on retracement levels</p>
<p>*All Industrials Index closed at 3,910.8 on Monday.</p>
<p>The Australian All Industrials Index has fallen off its recent highs, but is still above support at 3,900.</p>
